    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Player archetypes\"\n---\n\n\n\n\nSix style archetypes are fitted jointly on both leagues, with each feature measured relative to its own\nleague and season. Sub-types split each archetype further (e.g. *Alpha scorer*, *Floor general* and\n*Shot-making scorer* inside *On-ball creator*).\n\n![Average profile of each archetype (standard deviations from the league-season mean).](figures/step3_archetype_profiles.png)\n\n## How the mix has shifted\n\nShare of all minutes played by each archetype, by season.\n\n\n```{=html}\n<div>                            <div id=\"838dd671-7e68-437c-ac6e-1ca0e625d6ba\" class=\"plotly-graph-div\" style=\"height:430px; width:100%;\"></div>            <script type=\"text/javascript\">                                    window.PLOTLYENV=window.PLOTLYENV || {};                                    if (document.getElementById(\"838dd671-7e68-437c-ac6e-1ca0e625d6ba\")) {                    Plotly.newPlot(                        \"838dd671-7e68-437c-ac6e-1ca0e625d6ba\",                        [{\"hovertemplate\":\"Secondary guard: %{y:.0%}\\u003cextra\\u003e\\u003c\\u002fextra\\u003e\",\"legendgroup\":\"Secondary guard\",\"line\":{\"color\":\"#2a78d6\",\"width\":2},\"mode\":\"lines\",\"name\":\"Secondary guard\",\"showlegend\":true,\"x\":[2004,2005,2006,2007,2008,2009,2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025,2026],\"y\":[0.2254432207665675,0.223504774922943,0.2553630391006909,0.2338556381525098,0.2098466084240849,0.217705830829779,0.1945670159955874,0.1869605935929489,0.2217510793738901,0.1889490710412037,0.2011588151644428,0.1978500330001965,0.1963360815802475,0.2064919650147736,0.2083682882372957,0.2344680922601035,0.1987257068344902,0.2273166411722083,0.2033795569803544,0.1938405492692205,0.1609540585510786,0.1871269852754356,0.212449230696724],\"type\":\"scatter\",\"xaxis\":\"x\",\"yaxis\":\"y\"},{\"hovertemplate\":\"Connector forward: %{y:.0%}\\u003cextra\\u003e\\u003c\\u